  "description": "The all new Process X is aimed at nothing but ripping riders on the most technical terrain–a true monster on the trails. Designed for downhill enthusiasts who thrive on riding outside of the norm, no side hit is safe from its tires. Agile enough in the rear end to win Whip Offs, yet stable enough to absorb some of the biggest hits and inside lines on a World Cup track, it offers you everything you need in a bike to handle long days in the bike park, endless shuttle laps with your mates, or a good-vibes-only jump session. No matter what you throw at it, it’ll be there for the best memories you make.",
